---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import ServiceAreaList from '../components/ServiceAreaList.astro';
import ServiceExplorer from '../components/ServiceExplorer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Potts Plumbing | North Georgia Home Plumbing"
  description="Home plumbing services from Potts Plumbing, serving Talking Rock and communities across North Georgia."
  currentPage="home"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="container home-hero__grid">
        <div class="home-hero__copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Residential plumbing · North Georgia</p>
          <p class="home-hero__trust">Trusted by North Georgia</p>
          <h1>Thoughtful plumbing for North Georgia homes.</h1>
          <p class="home-hero__intro">From a persistent leak to a fixture update, Potts Plumbing helps homeowners with the plumbing work that keeps daily life moving. Garrett Potts serves communities across North Georgia.</p>
          <div class="contact-actions">
            <a class="email-action" href="mailto:gtpservices212@gmail.com">
              <span class="email-action__label">Email Garrett</span>
              <span class="email-action__address">gtpservices212@gmail.com</span>
            </a>
            <a class="phone-action" href="tel:+17706853901">(770) 685-3901</a>
          </div>
          <p class="home-hero__note">Share what is happening at home and the best way to reach you.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="brand-card" aria-label="Potts Plumbing services">
          <img class="brand-card__logo" src="/images/potts-wordmark.png" width="666" height="544" alt="Potts Plumbing, 770-685-3901" fetchpriority="high" />
          <div class="brand-card__standards">
            <div class="brand-card__standard">
              <Icon name="pricing" class="brand-card__icon" />
              <span>Transparent pricing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="brand-card__standard">
              <Icon name="service" class="brand-card__icon" />
              <span>Best-in-class service</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-introduction section-rule">
      <div class="container introduction-grid">
        <p class="eyebrow">A straightforward place to begin</p>
        <div>
          <h2>Good plumbing starts with a clear picture of the problem.</h2>
          <p>You do not need to diagnose the problem. Share what you have noticed, and Garrett can help clarify the issue, explain the options, and set clear expectations for the work and price.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-services section-tint">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">01 / Home plumbing</p>
            <h2>From small repairs to the projects around them.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Explore common home plumbing requests below. Open a service to see examples, or ask Garrett about a job that is not on the list.</p>
        </div>
        <ServiceExplorer openFirst={true} />
        <div class="section-after-link"><a href="/services/">See the full service overview</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-standards">
      <div class="container standards-panel">
        <div class="standards-panel__intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">02 / How the work should feel</p>
          <h2>Clear expectations make a better experience.</h2>
          <p>Garrett works with you to clarify the project, explain the proposed work, and discuss pricing before anything begins.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="standards-list">
          <article class="standard-item">
            <Icon name="pricing" class="standard-item__icon" />
            <div>
              <h3>Transparent pricing</h3>
              <p>Garrett explains the scope and price before work begins, so you can decide how you would like to proceed.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="standard-item">
            <Icon name="service" class="standard-item__icon" />
            <div>
              <h3>Best-in-class service</h3>
              <p>Thoughtful communication, respect for your home, and care in the details belong in every plumbing visit.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-service-area section-rule">
      <div class="container area-grid">
        <div class="area-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 / North Georgia</p>
          <h2>Local plumbing, across the region.</h2>
          <p>Potts Plumbing serves North Georgia communities, including the towns listed here. Contact Garrett to confirm service for your address and project.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask about your location</a>
        </div>
        <ServiceAreaList />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-contact-band">
      <div class="container home-contact-band__inner">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">A clear next step</p>
          <h2>Have a home plumbing project in mind?</h2>
          <p>Send a short note about the issue, the room, and your town.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home-contact-band__actions">
          <a class="button-light" href="mailto:gtpservices212@gmail.com">Email Garrett</a>
          <a href="tel:+17706853901">(770) 685-3901</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
